# AutoCSR — Frontend & Component Rules

## Design System

### Fonts (always load via next/font or Google Fonts link in layout)
- Display / headings: **Syne** (`font-family: var(--font-display)`)
- Body: **DM Sans** (`font-family: var(--font-body)`)
- Monospace / numbers / data: **JetBrains Mono** (`font-family: var(--font-mono)`)

### Color Palette
- Surface (darkest): `#0f0f14` — page backgrounds
- Surface-2: `#16161f` — card backgrounds
- Surface-3: `#1e1e2a` — elevated elements
- Accent: `#4f46e5` (indigo-600) — CTAs, active states, highlights
- Accent hover: `#4338ca` (indigo-700)
- Text primary: `#ffffff`
- Text secondary: `#888888`
- Text muted: `#444444`
- Border default: `#1e1e2e`
- Border hover: `#2a2a3a`

### Aesthetic Direction
**Enterprise dark.** Bloomberg Terminal meets Vercel dashboard.
- Sharp geometric layouts. Data-forward. Never playful or startup-cute.
- Numbers use JetBrains Mono always — never DM Sans for metrics
- Generous whitespace — nothing feels cramped
- Indigo as the ONLY accent color — no rainbow gradients
- Section dividers via border-bottom, never decorative HR tags

---

## Shadcn/ui

- Components live in `components/ui/` — generated by `bunx shadcn add`
- **Never modify generated Shadcn files directly** — wrap them instead
- Always use the Shadcn component, then override via `className` prop
- Tailwind v4 variant: when running `bunx shadcn init`, select Tailwind v4

### Component import pattern
```typescript
// ✅ Correct
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'
import { Input } from '@/components/ui/input'

// ❌ Never import from shadcn source directly
import { Button } from '@radix-ui/react-button'
```

---

## Motion (Framer Motion)

- Import from `'motion/react'` — not `'framer-motion'` (Framer renamed it)
- Use `AnimatePresence` for conditional renders — always set `mode="wait"` for swap animations
- Keep animations subtle for enterprise feel: duration 0.2–0.35s, ease `[0.22, 1, 0.36, 1]`
- Stagger section reveals on scroll: use `viewport={{ once: true }}` — animate once, don't re-trigger
- No bounce, elastic, or spring animations on data/metrics — those feel unserious
- Spinner: CSS `animate-spin` is fine — no Motion needed for loaders

### Scroll animation pattern
```typescript
<motion.div
  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 16 }}
  whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
  viewport={{ once: true, margin: '-60px' }}
  transition={{ duration: 0.4, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] }}
>
```

---

## Component Architecture

### Marketing components (`components/marketing/`)
- Server Components by default
- Extract interactive parts as separate `'use client'` components
- Props should be minimal — fetch data in the server component, pass down

### Dashboard components (`components/dashboard/`)
- Server Components for data display
- `'use client'` only for charts (Recharts needs browser), interactive filters
- Use Suspense boundaries at route level — `loading.tsx` files for skeleton states

### Naming & files
- One component per file
- File name = component name in kebab-case: `PilotForm` → `pilot-form.tsx`
- Export as named export, not default (easier to track with grep)

---

## Forms

- Use `useActionState` (React 19) — not `react-hook-form` for simple forms
- Always `noValidate` on `<form>` — handle validation server-side in the Action
- Show field-level errors next to the field, not in a toast
- Error text: `font-mono text-[11px] text-red-400` — consistent across all forms
- Disabled state during pending: `disabled={isPending}` on all inputs + submit
- Success state: replace the form entirely — don't just show a toast

---

## Accessibility

- Every `<img>` needs `alt` — empty string `alt=""` for decorative images
- Every form input needs a `<label>` — `sr-only` class is acceptable for visually hidden
- Error messages: `role="alert"` + `aria-live="polite"`
- Invalid fields: `aria-invalid={!!error}` + `aria-describedby="field-error-id"`
- Buttons with only an icon: `aria-label` required
- Interactive elements: `focus-visible:ring-2` — never remove focus rings

---

## Performance Rules

- `next/image` for ALL images — never raw `<img>` for user-facing content
- `next/font` for ALL fonts — never Google Fonts `<link>` in `<head>`
- No `useEffect` for data that can be fetched server-side
- Lazy load heavy client components: `const Chart = dynamic(() => import('./chart'), { ssr: false })`
- Recharts (charts): always `dynamic` import with `ssr: false` — it needs browser APIs
